WEBVTT

00:03.730 --> 00:07.650
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:03.730 --> 00:07.650
<b>The Fruit of Evolution 2:</b>

00:04.810 --> 00:07.650
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:04.810 --> 00:07.650
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

00:04.810 --> 00:07.650
<b>Before I Knew It, My Life Had It Made</b>

01:30.290 --> 01:35.220
<b>Reunited with Kannazuki Karen</b>

01:44.380 --> 01:47.240
Wha... K-Kannazuki-senpai?!

01:47.240 --> 01:49.690
This nostalgic smell...

01:50.380 --> 01:53.450
You may have changed 
appearances, Seiichi-kun,

01:53.450 --> 01:55.390
but you're still you.

01:55.390 --> 01:57.510
Uh, um...

01:57.510 --> 02:01.290
Care to explain this, Seiichi?

02:01.290 --> 02:04.430
You already have me and Saria.

02:04.430 --> 02:06.100
Hey! W-Wait!

02:06.100 --> 02:08.270
No excuses!

02:09.200 --> 02:10.670
Y-You've got the wrong idea, Ar!

02:10.670 --> 02:13.480
Like I'd allow a fifth or a sixth time!

02:13.480 --> 02:15.900
Teachers, please stop it!

02:15.900 --> 02:18.570
Stop this at once!

02:18.570 --> 02:25.490
<b>Beat Up</b>

02:19.810 --> 02:22.690
I'm so glad to see you're safe.

02:22.690 --> 02:25.490
I'm not safe at all, though.

02:25.490 --> 02:28.010
Behaving like that at school is a big problem!

02:28.010 --> 02:28.560
But—

02:28.560 --> 02:30.220
Please be more careful from now on!

02:29.210 --> 02:31.700
I sensed you nearby for a while.

02:31.700 --> 02:34.860
I'm so glad you're all right.

02:35.990 --> 02:37.730
Senpai... huh?

02:41.290 --> 02:42.900
I smell women.

02:42.900 --> 02:43.720
Huh?

02:43.720 --> 02:45.770
I smell women on you.

02:45.770 --> 02:46.990
Uh...

02:46.990 --> 02:50.170
I smell that sweat! 
You're flustered, aren't you?

02:50.170 --> 02:51.900
You sure have a keen nose!

02:52.330 --> 02:54.890
I thought it was odd back then!

02:54.890 --> 02:57.510
Why do I smell Seiichi-kun on you all?

02:57.510 --> 03:00.610
Why do I smell you all on Seiichi-kun?

03:00.980 --> 03:03.910
Depending on your answer, 
you won't get off easily!

03:03.910 --> 03:07.140
Oh? Now this is interesting.

03:16.760 --> 03:18.810
I am Kannazuki Karen!

03:18.810 --> 03:22.130
I have been with Seiichi-kun 
since forever ago!

03:22.130 --> 03:23.970
I am his childhood friend!

03:24.140 --> 03:25.570
<b>Childhood Friend</b>

03:25.980 --> 03:29.140
I am Artoria Gremm, Seiichi's girlfriend!

03:29.140 --> 03:32.030
Lulune. I'm Master's servant!

03:32.030 --> 03:34.620
Oliga. Onii-chan's little sister.

03:35.150 --> 03:35.580
<b>Girlfriend</b>

03:35.150 --> 03:35.580
<b>Little Sister</b>

03:35.150 --> 03:36.400
<b>Servant</b>

03:36.400 --> 03:38.340
<b>Servant</b>

03:37.860 --> 03:38.340
<b>Childhood Friend</b>

03:40.790 --> 03:42.220
<b>Childhood Friend</b>

03:41.920 --> 03:42.220
<b>Little Sister</b>

03:41.920 --> 03:42.220
<b>Girlfriend</b>

03:43.300 --> 03:44.300
<b>Little Sister</b>

03:43.300 --> 03:44.300
<b>Girlfriend</b>

03:43.540 --> 03:47.200
D-Damn it!

03:47.620 --> 03:48.750
We did it!

03:48.750 --> 03:50.380
Easy win!

03:50.750 --> 03:52.250
No, not yet.

03:52.250 --> 03:53.460
What?!

03:56.700 --> 03:58.300
Weak. Too weak.

03:58.300 --> 04:05.840
Heave-ho! Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

04:02.050 --> 04:05.840
<b>Wife</b>

04:05.840 --> 04:08.060
<b>Wife</b>

04:05.840 --> 04:08.060
Hello, nice to meet you!

04:08.060 --> 04:10.850
I guess we all share a bond now, huh?

04:08.060 --> 04:13.410
<b>Wife</b>

04:10.850 --> 04:13.690
Bonds with Seiichi are great bonds!

04:13.690 --> 04:15.820
I hope we get along, Kannazuki-san!

04:15.820 --> 04:17.980
I am his only one!

04:17.980 --> 04:19.500
I'm Saria!

04:19.500 --> 04:21.400
His wife!

04:21.400 --> 04:23.630
Wife! Wife!

04:22.490 --> 04:25.200
<b>Wife</b>

04:23.630 --> 04:25.200
His wife!

04:25.200 --> 04:26.810
I'm Saria!

04:26.810 --> 04:28.620
His wife!

04:28.620 --> 04:33.020
I'm Seiichi's wife!

04:31.700 --> 04:36.420
The ultimate wife!

04:32.040 --> 04:33.960
<b>Wife</b>

04:41.130 --> 04:43.090
I-I lost...

04:43.830 --> 04:45.940
Kannazuki-senpai, are you okay?

04:46.960 --> 04:48.390
Seiichi-kun...

04:49.010 --> 04:52.400
I'm so happy to be held by you...

04:52.400 --> 04:54.310
Let's get you to the nurse's office.

04:55.580 --> 04:57.870
I'll be excusing myself, then.

04:57.870 --> 04:59.900
Please take your time.

05:02.070 --> 05:04.360
Do you love Seiichi, too?

05:04.360 --> 05:08.160
S-Seiichi-kun's just my childhood friend...

05:08.160 --> 05:11.560
If that was all you two were, 
we wouldn't have had that battle.

05:11.560 --> 05:16.500
E-Even if that's true, we're supposed 
to keep it tucked away in our hearts!

05:16.890 --> 05:21.920
You know, I love it when 
Seiichi is happy and smiling!

05:21.920 --> 05:26.720
I-In that case, I love how brave 
he looks when he's fighting.

05:26.990 --> 05:31.160
I love the feel of his plump 
butt when he's riding me!

05:31.160 --> 05:34.310
I love it when he pets me with his big hands.

05:34.310 --> 05:36.470
Hey, you guys...

05:37.600 --> 05:40.280
<b>Childhood Friend</b>

05:40.280 --> 05:41.610
She's fired up again?!

05:45.370 --> 05:48.970
Long ago, Seiichi-kun saved me.

05:50.490 --> 05:54.330
When I was young, I was often bullied.

05:51.090 --> 05:52.090
Take that!

05:52.820 --> 05:54.330
Stop it!

05:54.330 --> 05:55.450
Here it is!

05:54.330 --> 05:58.030
All because I was willful and brash.

05:56.290 --> 05:57.670
Give it back!

05:59.000 --> 06:01.580
Nyah! You're a boy! A boy!

06:01.580 --> 06:02.650
I'm a girl!

06:02.650 --> 06:04.360
Here, pass!

06:04.360 --> 06:06.800
If you don't like it, try and take it back!

06:06.800 --> 06:08.760
None of you could do anything on your own!

06:08.760 --> 06:10.470
I heard that!

06:10.470 --> 06:12.160
That's when he appeared.

06:12.160 --> 06:13.320
Stop it!

06:14.610 --> 06:15.810
No violence!

06:16.050 --> 06:17.610
No violence!

06:17.610 --> 06:18.730
No violence!

06:18.970 --> 06:20.130
What?!

06:20.130 --> 06:21.440
You fatty!

06:21.440 --> 06:22.900
We'll bully you, too!

06:22.900 --> 06:24.650
You little brat!

06:25.700 --> 06:27.530
N-No violence!

06:28.810 --> 06:32.300
Seiichi-kun was braver than anyone else.

06:35.220 --> 06:37.540
Thank you so much for today.

06:37.540 --> 06:39.880
Why did you save me?

06:39.880 --> 06:45.380
My mom and dad always taught me 
to help people who are in trouble.

06:46.280 --> 06:48.300
Hey, Seiichi-kun?

06:48.300 --> 06:49.240
What?

06:49.240 --> 06:52.300
Do I really seem a boy?

06:52.580 --> 06:55.930
Hmm... I don't know.

06:59.370 --> 07:01.190
But you're fine just the way you are!

07:11.460 --> 07:12.760
Thank you.

07:14.980 --> 07:18.250
Later, I learned from our neighbors that

07:18.250 --> 07:21.720
Seiichi-kun had already lost 
his parents in an accident.

07:22.050 --> 07:23.050
So I wondered,

07:23.050 --> 07:27.880
how was he able to smile 
without worry, despite all that?

07:30.170 --> 07:34.600
Yet because Seiichi-kun 
defended me that day...

07:30.340 --> 07:31.750
Nyah!

07:31.750 --> 07:33.130
Give it back!

07:35.650 --> 07:37.260
Get over yourself, fatty!

07:37.260 --> 07:38.970
N-No violence...

07:39.230 --> 07:40.920
No violence!

07:41.890 --> 07:42.640
<b>Smelly</b>

07:41.890 --> 07:42.640
<b>Idiot</b>

07:41.890 --> 07:43.230
<b>Creep</b>

07:41.890 --> 07:43.730
<b>Fatty</b>

07:41.890 --> 07:45.810
I found myself unable to lend 
Seiichi-kun a hand or do anything else.

07:54.040 --> 07:55.570
Seiichi-k—

08:03.110 --> 08:04.290
I'm sorry.

08:04.840 --> 08:06.340
Seiichi?

08:06.340 --> 08:07.700
The truth is...

08:07.700 --> 08:11.340
I came here from another world, just 
like Kannazuki-senpai and the others.

08:12.590 --> 08:17.320
But I'm not as impressive 
as you all think I am.

08:24.830 --> 08:28.480
This is how I really look.

08:40.900 --> 08:42.190
Surprised, aren't you?

08:43.270 --> 08:44.580
I'm fat and ugly.

08:44.580 --> 08:47.630
I'm also short, and smelly, too.

08:48.370 --> 08:52.510
The way I looked before was all 
thanks to the Fruit of Evolution.

08:52.510 --> 08:54.250
Hang on a second.

08:54.250 --> 08:56.300
This is all going too fast. I can't keep up.

08:56.790 --> 08:58.180
Yeah!

09:00.030 --> 09:02.040
I'm sorry, Seiichi-kun.

09:02.040 --> 09:04.810
I said things I shouldn't have.

09:05.150 --> 09:06.730
Please don't pay it any mind.

09:06.730 --> 09:09.290
It was something I had 
to talk about eventually.

09:14.190 --> 09:16.940
See? Even if I wear this,

09:16.940 --> 09:18.370
I still look lame, right?

09:18.370 --> 09:20.040
Seiichi...

09:20.040 --> 09:24.040
The real Hiiragi Seiichi 
is nothing like you know.

09:24.540 --> 09:29.200
I'm really sorry for deceiving 
you all for so long.

09:29.200 --> 09:31.160
Look at me, Seiichi.

09:31.160 --> 09:31.960
Huh?

09:32.550 --> 09:34.760
You're still you, right?

09:38.530 --> 09:41.690
I'm a Kaiser Kong, but I'm also Saria!

09:41.690 --> 09:44.870
Past, present, truth, 
lies, none of it matters!

09:44.870 --> 09:46.200
I love you!

09:46.200 --> 09:48.230
I love you because you're you!

09:49.090 --> 09:50.370
Saria...

09:50.750 --> 09:52.530
Don't misjudge us.

09:52.530 --> 09:55.930
You're still the one who accepted me,

09:55.930 --> 09:58.200
even though I bore the title of "Calamity."

09:59.190 --> 10:00.490
Ar...

10:00.490 --> 10:04.610
I've stained my hands with 
many lives as an assassin.

10:04.970 --> 10:08.570
Yet you still hold those hands for me,

10:08.570 --> 10:10.850
and pet my head.

10:10.850 --> 10:13.070
So now it's my turn.

10:13.980 --> 10:15.510
There, there.

10:15.990 --> 10:17.270
Oliga-chan...

10:17.720 --> 10:22.780
Master, you're one of the precious 
few people who give me food!

10:22.780 --> 10:27.520
Not to mention, you look pretty tasty 
yourself right now, so no problems here!

10:27.520 --> 10:29.450
Lulune, that's its own problem.

10:29.450 --> 10:30.560
Is it really?

10:30.560 --> 10:32.310
See, Seiichi?

10:35.460 --> 10:37.980
Everyone loves you!

10:38.430 --> 10:40.910
So have more confidence in yourself, Seiichi!

10:49.950 --> 10:50.920
You guys...

10:54.660 --> 10:56.670
Thank you, everyone.

10:57.780 --> 10:59.400
What lovely relationships.

10:59.770 --> 11:01.760
I'm relieved, Seiichi-kun.

11:02.600 --> 11:06.880
I'm only who I am today thanks to 
all the people I've met along the way.

11:06.880 --> 11:09.180
Of course, that includes 
you, Kannazuki-senpai.

11:10.060 --> 11:11.340
Seiichi-kun...

11:13.630 --> 11:14.480
I'm sorry.

11:14.990 --> 11:15.900
Huh?

11:16.360 --> 11:18.940
You probably shouldn't be 
involved with me anymore.

11:19.420 --> 11:21.110
What do you mean?

11:21.720 --> 11:23.110
As you know,

11:23.110 --> 11:28.790
we hero candidates were sent to 
this academy by the Kaiser Empire.

11:28.790 --> 11:31.210
Yes, Barna-san mentioned that.

11:32.120 --> 11:36.690
They enrolled as hero candidates 
from the Kaiser Empire,

11:37.370 --> 11:39.880
but their latent abilities are so strong

11:39.880 --> 11:42.760
that they've been ostracized 
by our original students,

11:42.760 --> 11:45.130
and there's no end to the quarrels.

11:46.100 --> 11:48.070
I wouldn't call it quarreling

11:48.070 --> 11:51.670
so much as to say that we 
could be attacked at any time.

11:51.670 --> 11:53.710
The situation's that awful?

11:53.710 --> 11:55.790
Which is why I can't get you caught up in it.

11:56.130 --> 12:00.570
If the students who used to know the old 
you start spreading heartless rumors,

12:00.570 --> 12:03.210
and you end up being 
targeted because of them...

12:03.210 --> 12:06.700
That kind of thing's a walk 
in the park for Master!

12:06.700 --> 12:08.120
Even so!

12:08.570 --> 12:13.540
I don't want to drag Seiichi-kun 
into a world of violence yet again!

12:15.480 --> 12:18.960
This time, I'll be the one to protect you.

12:19.400 --> 12:23.760
Seiichi-kun, I'm truly glad 
that you've found happiness.

12:24.520 --> 12:26.170
Kannazuki-senpai...

12:27.090 --> 12:28.720
See you later, Seiichi-kun.

12:36.520 --> 12:38.390
What's the matter, Oliga-chan?

12:38.390 --> 12:40.120
Th-That bracelet!

12:40.120 --> 12:40.650
Huh?

12:42.990 --> 12:43.670
Hey!

12:43.980 --> 12:45.270
What's the matter?

12:45.270 --> 12:48.950
Kannazuki-senpai, where exactly 
did you get that bracelet?

12:49.370 --> 12:54.160
This was provided to us by the Kaiser 
Empire when we arrived in this world.

12:54.160 --> 12:57.670
They said it would help raise our Status.

12:57.670 --> 12:59.250
Skill: Appraisal!

13:02.110 --> 13:03.380
<i>I knew it.</i>

13:04.430 --> 13:07.020
<i>The Enslavement Bracelet!</i>

13:09.510 --> 13:10.430
Ow!

13:11.290 --> 13:13.270
<i>They'll pay!</i>

13:14.310 --> 13:16.150
<i>They'll pay for this!</i>

13:44.290 --> 13:46.910
M-My head!

13:50.600 --> 13:51.960
Kannazuki-san!

13:53.580 --> 13:55.180
What's going on here?!

13:55.180 --> 13:57.350
Onii-chan! Onii-chan!

13:57.350 --> 13:58.820
Seiichi!

14:00.060 --> 14:01.100
Seiichi!

14:01.100 --> 14:02.060
Master!

14:02.060 --> 14:06.040
What on earth is wrong with you?!

14:15.560 --> 14:17.270
What is this?!

14:19.420 --> 14:21.840
So it's finally here?

14:29.160 --> 14:31.300
Muscle!

14:52.580 --> 14:54.030
Found you!

15:08.090 --> 15:09.110
Seiichi!

15:10.100 --> 15:11.610
Seiichi!

15:12.330 --> 15:13.970
Seiichi!

15:14.470 --> 15:17.540
Seiichi!

15:21.950 --> 15:23.000
Huh?

15:25.080 --> 15:26.470
Uh...

15:28.420 --> 15:30.900
Seiichi, are you okay?

15:30.900 --> 15:32.420
Saria?

15:32.850 --> 15:34.820
Onii-chan!

15:35.470 --> 15:37.160
Onii-chan!

15:38.190 --> 15:40.660
Onii-chan, are you okay?

15:41.880 --> 15:43.100
Oliga-chan?

15:43.100 --> 15:44.370
Master!

15:44.370 --> 15:45.100
Seiichi!

15:45.100 --> 15:46.880
Master!

15:46.880 --> 15:49.510
Seiichi! How dare you worry us like that?!

15:49.510 --> 15:52.380
Huh? Oh, sorry.

15:53.730 --> 15:55.350
Kannazuki-senpai!

15:55.350 --> 15:56.650
Kannazuki-senpai!

15:59.800 --> 16:01.850
Are you okay, Senpai?!

16:01.850 --> 16:05.070
Yeah, I suddenly felt faint for some reason...

16:05.630 --> 16:09.390
Though this situation I'm in 
now certainly isn't a bad one.

16:09.390 --> 16:10.880
Senpai?! Um, huh?

16:10.880 --> 16:12.390
Were you always like this?

16:12.390 --> 16:13.280
Senpai?!

16:15.700 --> 16:20.370
So you're saying we were being 
manipulated by the Kaiser Empire?

16:20.370 --> 16:25.260
Fortunately, it looks like no orders had 
been issued through that bracelet yet.

16:25.260 --> 16:27.630
But if it was still on...

16:27.630 --> 16:31.630
A bracelet that manipulates the 
will of the one wearing it?

16:32.230 --> 16:34.970
Why on earth would the 
Kaiser Empire use such a thing?

16:34.970 --> 16:39.060
Most likely to use you as tools 
for defeating the Demon Lord.

16:39.350 --> 16:40.870
Principal?

16:40.870 --> 16:44.860
You do know that the Wimberg Kingdom 
is trying to forge an alliance

16:44.860 --> 16:46.650
with the Demon Lord Army, right?

16:47.170 --> 16:49.070
Now that you mention it...

16:50.290 --> 16:53.750
The Kaiser Empire is a troublesome nation.

16:53.750 --> 16:55.990
I've heard rumors that

16:55.990 --> 16:59.470
they're trying to stop other nations 
from allying with each other

16:59.470 --> 17:01.130
in order to achieve world domination.

17:01.130 --> 17:02.620
World domination?!

17:02.620 --> 17:04.500
You mean...

17:04.500 --> 17:09.020
They're trying to use the heroes 
to destroy the Demon Lord Army,

17:09.020 --> 17:12.420
the Wimberg Kingdom, or possibly even both.

17:12.420 --> 17:14.030
No way...

17:14.030 --> 17:16.840
Though that's just my speculation.

17:17.460 --> 17:22.020
The silver lining is that now the bracelets 
on the hero candidates are broken.

17:23.570 --> 17:25.690
You have my thanks, Seiichi-kun.

17:25.690 --> 17:26.460
Huh?

17:27.240 --> 17:29.110
Oh, it was nothing.

17:31.460 --> 17:33.640
B-Barna-san?

17:37.860 --> 17:42.680
Please do remember to keep this a 
secret from the other students.

17:42.680 --> 17:43.750
Got it?

17:44.790 --> 17:48.230
I can't believe we were brought 
to such a terrifying nation.

17:48.230 --> 17:49.730
It's all right!

17:49.730 --> 17:51.170
Seiichi-kun?

17:51.170 --> 17:52.470
It's all right.

17:52.470 --> 17:55.340
No matter what happens, I'll protect you!

18:00.470 --> 18:04.760
Master! Stop staring at each 
other so we can get food already!

18:04.760 --> 18:06.270
Didn't you just eat earlier?

18:06.270 --> 18:09.010
That was then! This is now!

18:09.010 --> 18:10.310
Let's go, Seiichi.

18:10.640 --> 18:11.400
Yeah.

18:13.960 --> 18:14.860
Seiichi-kun.

18:16.190 --> 18:17.280
Yes?

18:17.670 --> 18:18.660
How about it?

18:18.660 --> 18:23.200
Would you let me join your 
group in a new role?

18:23.770 --> 18:27.620
I don't mind, of course, but what role?

18:27.880 --> 18:31.340
Make me your older sister!

18:32.420 --> 18:35.340
Sister?

18:35.340 --> 18:36.760
Why do you look freaked out?!

18:36.760 --> 18:38.940
I thought it was an appealing role.

18:38.940 --> 18:41.020
No, please spare me that, Senpai.

18:41.020 --> 18:41.760
Why not?

18:41.760 --> 18:42.610
Well, just because!

18:42.610 --> 18:43.220
Why not?

18:43.220 --> 18:44.330
I mean, just because!

18:44.330 --> 18:45.180
But an older sister's—

18:44.630 --> 18:45.880
<i>Sei-chan...</i>

18:45.180 --> 18:46.680
No more!

18:54.520 --> 18:56.530
Did you notice, Angrea?

18:56.780 --> 18:59.200
A surge like that? Of course I did.

18:59.550 --> 19:01.140
How nostalgic.

19:01.140 --> 19:02.810
That was truly...

19:03.210 --> 19:07.930
<i>What are you doing there, Demioros, Angrea?</i>

19:07.930 --> 19:09.290
<i>Down here.</i>

19:09.510 --> 19:10.570
<i>It's me.</i>

19:10.570 --> 19:12.710
<i>Helio from the Kaiser Empire.</i>

19:12.710 --> 19:13.880
Gross!

19:14.110 --> 19:15.340
Wh-What did you want?

19:15.570 --> 19:17.260
<i>Don't be surprised,</i>

19:17.490 --> 19:20.180
<i>but the Enslavement Bracelets 
have been broken!</i>

19:20.550 --> 19:21.500
So?

19:22.090 --> 19:23.650
<i>How are you so calm?!</i>

19:23.650 --> 19:28.170
<i>Now everything that went into training 
those hero candidates is all for naught!</i>

19:28.170 --> 19:30.050
<i>The whole plan to sow chaos at the academy</i>

19:30.050 --> 19:34.380
<i>and gather negative energy for 
the Great Devil's revival is now—</i>

19:34.380 --> 19:38.530
We were planning on getting 
that plan started here soon.

19:39.290 --> 19:41.660
Right after a bit of a late lunch.

19:41.660 --> 19:44.660
<i>You think this is the time 
for a leisurely lunch?!</i>

19:44.660 --> 19:47.200
If you get too angry, 
you'll give yourself more wrinkles.

19:47.200 --> 19:48.810
<i>That's none of your concern!</i>

19:48.810 --> 19:51.570
<i>By the way, that surge from earlier...</i>

19:51.570 --> 19:52.370
Yes, that.

19:52.580 --> 19:54.790
What exactly was that?

19:54.790 --> 19:57.170
<i>Even I don't quite know.</i>

19:57.170 --> 19:57.990
<i>But...</i>

19:57.990 --> 20:02.880
<i>That surge did drastically increase the 
strength of the Great Devil's darkness.</i>

20:03.240 --> 20:04.810
I-It did?!

20:06.820 --> 20:09.530
<i>The Great Devil's revival is nigh!</i>

20:09.530 --> 20:14.810
<i>Work hard, apostles of the Great Devil 
Order, Deliverance and Murder Princess!</i>

20:14.810 --> 20:17.130
<i>Now is the time for your—</i>

20:17.130 --> 20:19.940
<i>Hey! Stop! Stop it! You—</i>

20:20.890 --> 20:23.610
I'm surprised it affected the Great Devil.

20:24.270 --> 20:27.150
That makes them even more worth killing.

20:29.380 --> 20:31.030
Wait, gross!

20:31.030 --> 20:33.630
Why does this coffee smell 
like old man stench?!

20:34.840 --> 20:36.530
I swallowed some!

22:19.090 --> 22:21.630
Hello! It's your older sister, Kannazuki!

22:21.630 --> 22:24.310
Now, everyone, as you've already heard,

22:24.310 --> 22:28.570
the role of older sister has finally 
been added to our group!

22:28.570 --> 22:30.840
Why is she taking charge here?

22:30.840 --> 22:31.330
Dunno.

22:31.330 --> 22:32.080
Me!

22:32.080 --> 22:33.400
Yes, Oliga-kun?

22:33.730 --> 22:35.310
Onee-chan's scary!

22:35.310 --> 22:37.910
Oh, there, there.

22:35.910 --> 22:38.440
Hey! You made her cry!

22:38.440 --> 22:40.460
My bad! I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

22:40.460 --> 22:42.490
I'll stop with the older sister thing.

22:42.820 --> 22:43.610
Really?

22:43.610 --> 22:44.840
Um, uh...

22:44.840 --> 22:46.380
How about retainer, then?

22:46.380 --> 22:48.290
Wouldn't that overlap with servant?

22:48.290 --> 22:49.540
Then what about employee?

22:49.540 --> 22:51.940
I think that still overlaps.

22:51.940 --> 22:54.750
What's wrong with Kannazuki-senpai, anyway?

22:54.750 --> 22:59.220
I'm Kannazuki. 
Seiichi-kun's Kannazuki-senpai!

22:59.220 --> 23:02.090
See, it's weird to have my name 
and role be the same thing.

23:02.090 --> 23:04.770
Then... Smell-Him-I-Cannazuki-senpai!

23:04.770 --> 23:06.460
Don't make a pun of my name.

23:06.460 --> 23:08.290
Stop-Smelling-Me-Mannazuki-senpai!

23:08.290 --> 23:10.130
I said stop playing with my name!

23:10.130 --> 23:12.380
And please let me smell you.

23:12.380 --> 23:14.070
Sniffer-nazuki-senpai!

23:14.070 --> 23:16.840
You can't just add "-nazuki" 
to the end of everything!

23:16.840 --> 23:19.250
I know I did sniff a lot, but still!

23:19.250 --> 23:22.350
<b>Rumble</b>

23:19.250 --> 23:22.350
<b>Nanjourno</b>

23:19.560 --> 23:21.050
Nanjourno!

23:21.050 --> 23:23.820
Where did you get Nanjourno from?!

23:23.820 --> 23:26.980
Also, what I'm asking for 
is a role, not a nickname!

23:26.980 --> 23:29.100
Childhood friend isn't good enough?

23:29.100 --> 23:30.430
Like I said...

23:30.890 --> 23:32.610
Wait, that's an option!

23:32.610 --> 23:34.520
Nanjourno.

23:35.700 --> 23:38.560
The class competition between Class F 
and Class S finally starts.

23:38.850 --> 23:41.350
Meanwhile, Seiichi is 
struck by sudden tragedy,

23:40.660 --> 23:41.350
<b>Gruuumble</b>

23:41.350 --> 23:43.730
and uninvited guests make an appearance!

23:43.730 --> 23:45.720
Next time, "Apostles Attack"!

23:43.730 --> 23:46.460
<b>Next Time
Apostles Attack</b>

23:45.720 --> 23:48.150
We'll have fan service for you next time, too!
